:: MP Job Clock Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobClockEncounter to 1>>
老火车站的副站长把一块银壳铁路怀表搁在绒布正中，说它每到整点报时前总会慢上三刻，已经误了两班车的交接。柜台另一头，古董商订的那只镂空机芯怀表还摊在放大镜下，等着换零件。你刚把镊子伸进去，最薄的那枚擒纵齿轮就在指间崩掉了一角。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-clock-enc">
<<mpclockworkicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 220>><<link "校正整点误差 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-clock-enc">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你把时轮与分轮的间隙一格一格调回原位，又照着站台的班次表把报时提前了半分钟。副站长对着怀表和月台的铜钟核了两遍，临走前往绒布边压了一枚银币。<span class="green">铁路怀表的整点报时重新对上了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_clock_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 560>><</if>>
	<<mathsskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	指腹一滑，游丝被带偏了半圈，怀表索性停在了七点一刻。副站长皱着眉把表收回衣袋，说改日再来。<span class="red">你只能先把镊子上的表油擦干净。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回高街 (0:08)|High Street]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[校正整点误差 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "校正整点误差">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 220>><<link "换上备用齿轮 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-clock-enc">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你从料盒里挑出一枚齿距相合的旧轮，用油石把轴颈磨到刚好卡进夹板，擒纵叉重新咬住了轮齿。古董商戴上单眼放大镜看了半晌，把这只表的修价当场结给铺子。<span class="green">镂空机芯重新走起来了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_clock_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 520>><</if>>
	<<scienceskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	备用轮厚了半分，硬压下去时连轴尖也折在夹板里。碎件落进绒布缝，你只能把它扫进废料盒。<span class="red">古董商沉着脸说改天再来看。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回高街 (0:08)|High Street]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[换上备用齿轮 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "换上备用齿轮">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "登记两桩送修 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-clock-enc">>
你把两块表的主顾、毛病和取件的日子一笔笔记进委托簿，又把崩下来的碎齿扫进废料盒，台面擦了两遍。<span class="teal">两边都算有了交代，只是活计要等旁人接手。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回高街 (0:08)|High Street]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Laundry Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobLaundryEncounter to 1>>
管事把一件神殿送洗的白法衣摊在案上，前襟洇开一大片靛蓝，像是跟深色衣物混包时染上的。她翻过送洗簿，又点出少了一条绣着名字的床单。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>抱着刚收下来的湿布站在门口，不敢出声。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-laundry-enc">
<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<link "重洗染色法衣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-laundry-enc">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你用温皂水兑了一点草酸，把染蓝的前襟反复浸洗，又用清水过了三遍。靛色褪成一层浅影，管事对着光看了半晌，把这一件的工钱记在你名下。<span class="green">法衣赶在晚祷前重新浆好了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_laundry_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 480>><</if>>
	<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	草酸兑得太浓，袖口被蚀出一圈毛边，靛蓝反倒渗得更深。管事把法衣从盆里提起来，说这桩活计只能另请人修补。<span class="red">你把手在围裙上擦了两遍。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回孤儿院 (0:08)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[重洗染色法衣 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "重洗染色法衣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 220>><<link "核对绣名簿 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-laundry-enc">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你把送洗簿上的编号与床单角上的花体绣名逐一对照，查出那条床单被隔壁街的洗衣妇错领走了。管事按着地址把布取了回来，顺手把对账的赏钱塞给你。<span class="green">少掉的那一条又回到了架子上。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_laundry_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 440>><</if>>
	<<englishskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	绣字被水汽泡得发虚，你认错了一个字母，白跑了一趟隔壁街，回来时盆里的水已经凉了。<span class="red">管事没说什么，只把簿子合上。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回孤儿院 (0:08)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[核对绣名簿 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "核对绣名簿">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mptailoricon>><<link "先把法衣晾起 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-laundry-enc">>
你把染了色的法衣单独挂到通风的竹竿上，又给送洗簿压了一块干布。架子上的布一件件归了位，少掉的那条床单和这件法衣都还悬着。<span class="teal">至少眼下没有再添新的错处。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回孤儿院 (0:08)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
</div>
